  }, "pranayama"), " variations), participants regularly experience profound emotional releases, trembling, and temporary muscle cramping (tetany). Polyvagal narratives attribute this to the \"discharge of sympathetic energy via ventral activation.\""), mdx("p", null, "The actual chemical reality is driven by a rapid alteration of blood gas chemistry:"), mdx("ul", null, mdx("li", {
    parentName: "ul"
  }, mdx("strong", {
    parentName: "li"
  }, "The Purge of Carbon Dioxide:"), " Rapid, deep, and continuous breathing offloads carbon dioxide (CO\u2082) from the lungs' alveoli faster than the cells produce it. This causes blood CO\u2082 levels to drop precipitously, a state known as ", mdx("strong", {
    parentName: "li"
  }, "hypocapnia"), "."), mdx("li", {
    parentName: "ul"
  }, mdx("strong", {
    parentName: "li"
