  }, "somatic sovereignty"), ": the state in which an individual exhibits parasympathetic dominance, low baseline cortisol, slow blink rates, unhurried physical transitions, and zero throat-tightening under social observation (see Embodied Male Status - Parasympathetic Sovereignty, Low Physical Noise, and the Micro-Physics of Non-Performative Authority)."), mdx("p", null, "When observing a man who commands a room without raising his voice, the intuitive tendency is to treat his composure as a self-contained biological achievement\u2014an innate psychological virtue or a well-earned personal discipline."), mdx("p", null, "This paper proposes an alternative biophysical and economic thesis: ", mdx("strong", {
